#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Serial-driver.rst:5
#: 443666d3c6d74166bc44b9d28db3a6b3
msgid "MATLAB Serial driver testing"
msgstr "MATLAB 串口驱动测试"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Serial-driver.rst:7
#: b0b722f1e2f648debd3c47b36407acd8
msgid ""
"The TCP/UDP/IP Toolbox can also be used to interact directly with SITL "
"serial ports. This allows MATLAB to be used to replicate a sensor protocol "
"fore testing and debugging ArduPilot drivers. Unlike previous examples TCP "
"is used and two way communication is possible. By default SITL uses ports "
"5760 to 5763 for serial ports 0 to 3. The appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL "
"parameter should be set to the driver being tested, baud rate is not used. "
"Such a MATLAB tool greatly speeds up development of drivers removing the "
"need to flash and test on real hardware."
msgstr ""
"TCP/UDP/IP 工具箱也可用于直接与 SITL (软件在环仿真) 串口交互。这允许使用 MATLAB 复现传感器协议，以便测试和调试 "
"ArduPilot 驱动。与前面的示例不同，这里使用 TCP 并支持双向通信。默认情况下，SITL 使用端口 5760 至 5763 对应串口 0 至 "
"3。应将相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数设置为被测驱动，波特率不使用。此类 MATLAB "
"工具大大加快了传感器驱动的开发速度，无需烧录到真实硬件上进行测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Serial-driver.rst:13
